eived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fallow-rs/fallow/commit/6d5e70430876ea901505f2b093c9d20ef72e213f","node_id":"C_kwDORpPJVNoAKDZkNWU3MDQzMDg3NmVhOTAxNTA1ZjJiMDkzYzlkMjBlZjcyZTIxM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fallow-rs/fallow/commit/c5ae50eed6c5836f33b9f4e5808306f18dbe2326","sha":"c5ae50eed6c5836f33b9f4e5808306f18dbe2326","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fallow-rs/fallow/commits/c5ae50eed6c5836f33b9f4e5808306f18dbe2326"}],"sha":"6d5e70430876ea901505f2b093c9d20ef72e213f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fallow-rs/fallow/commits/6d5e70430876ea901505f2b093c9d20ef72e213f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1352352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BartWaardenburg","id":1352352,"login":"BartWaardenburg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTIzNTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fallow-rs/fallow/commits/c5ae50eed6c5836f33b9f4e5808306f18dbe2326/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:02:45Z","email":"bart@waardenburg.dev","name":"Bart Waardenburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:02:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(release): keep macOS C code out of the PGO build (#3286)\n\ncc forwards -Cprofile-generate and -Cprofile-use to the C compiler. On\nmacOS, Apple clang writes an older raw profile format than the Rust 1.99\nprofiler runtime. The instrumented binary then crashes at exit in\n__llvm_profile_write_file.\n\nThe macOS PGO steps now set CFLAGS_<target> and CXXFLAGS_<target> to\n-fno-profile-generate and -fno-profile-use. The policy test checks both\nworkflows. Remove the workaround after rust-lang/cc-rs#1986 is released\n(tracked in #3285).","tree":{"sha":"8f04aa1156e72f2ace50d8c5838822f70b6bd222","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fallow-rs/fallow/git/trees/8f04aa1156e72f2ace50d8c5838822f70b6bd222"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fallow-rs/fallow/git/commits/c5ae50eed6c5836f33b9f4e5808306f18dbe2326","verification":{"payload":"tree 8f04aa1156e72f2ace50d8c5838822f70b6bd222\nparent e6171c44aeb28eeaa3dca5f71046ff1b9221bcdf\nauthor Bart Waardenburg <bart@waardenburg.dev> 1791453765 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791453765 +0000\n\nfix(release): keep macOS C code out of the PGO build (#3286)\n\ncc forwards -Cprofile-generate and -Cprofile-use to the C compiler. On\nmacOS, Apple clang writes an older raw profile format than the Rust 1.99\nprofiler runtime. The instrumented binary then crashes at exit in\n__llvm_profile_write_file.\n\nThe macOS PGO steps now set CFLAGS_<target> and CXXFLAGS_<target> to\n-fno-profile-generate and -fno-profile-use. The policy test checks both\nworkflows. Remove the workaround after rust-lang/cc-rs#1986 is released\n(tracked in #3285).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx2pFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA