status paths with forward slashes on Windows (#3237)\n\n`display_rel` now returns `/` on every platform through the `agent_install::display_path` helper. The hook status JSON, the agent status rows and the install lines no longer use backslashes on Windows. The Windows path filter now lists `agent_install/mod.rs` and `agent_install/status.rs`.","tree":{"sha":"f90dbed0c58125fd53af0f8533bee9ac3a2ea71e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fallow-rs/fallow/git/trees/f90dbed0c58125fd53af0f8533bee9ac3a2ea71e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fallow-rs/fallow/git/commits/14a648df3927d893cedb074154c72bd564602eba","verification":{"payload":"tree f90dbed0c58125fd53af0f8533bee9ac3a2ea71e\nparent a7de13161ac896e4ef1298fd7557dd9db31143c9\nauthor Bart Waardenburg <bart@waardenburg.dev> 1791271925 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791271925 +0200\n\nfix(agent): show hook status paths with forward slashes on Windows (#3237)\n\n`display_rel` now returns `/` on every platform through the `agent_install::display_path` helper. The hook status JSON, the agent status rows and the install lines no longer use backslashes on Windows. The Windows path filter now lists `agent_install/mod.rs` and `agent_install/status.rs`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxKP1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAn40QAH9PNX9njU4h92RcyGzC43nd\nGVBjUSZqrrPnZu0UIshrmVJWyuDMUjI+TV7fAA3x3tVk+P9ttBmh5mWpRRrs/aGK\n9tacEgmka5+3TaR4pE20J8/mkKEaDyT9FAdvd4gnw/r4Gb9Eg0lebGlXWaKnEIi/\nLzOwzaPLWBlNRgO60Y6sZq5kBGQq2J9TAFAqQwA/qBKa0SCTGGx4sGoqep1b/Ckb\nil/Uo+3Gjwh4XJMMlXVLLlckmJ/iLaT0KGYLqbbOfX+jggmsFF69L/jbd5yB+IN5\nQuBLlwFElLoVU4M7hD+QbJsyqoF1l8ZP2HNlyLBnuEZQavcmPXwf+KU+q4R6BJVe\ndfkA8Ymp2TxZPmIUiyBUofgSGRH9jmOUHv20jGtplwmoe4ELqDaLM+2RJgSx9VKY\nap8RdozznDScD7AUeDhZGeMkgHfRuorXDARx2miI82LtYszs9PJghq2Fte8hsEii\nknZ1IAr7NgCyo550JksiuTMf3MeBBUcNZFSAPROKbtCr8/vZe9v3bYyr29KMf0z7\nA3qJZ/G/YYUOvccCZ3SJRD6yvw8G5IXAr0X4GNRsn8uvdW7JNr8wWa0Y+uCt+dqn\n6Cvg70cRbXFLTO2nGkL+3cDN+gQvuhmTK2TMhsjSl09N8