ttps://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BartWaardenburg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fallow-rs/fallow/commits/920b2c0e2e05c2e0e718235a933f0ddab5f8e432/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T04:28:56Z","email":"bart@waardenburg.dev","name":"Bart Waardenburg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T04:28:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(policy): check gdp proof calls across repeated script imports (#3233)\n\nA Vue, Svelte, or Astro file can import the same name in two script\nblocks. The gdp-proof-producer rule abstained on every repeated name,\nso a defineProof call in such a file gave no finding. The rule now\nabstains only when the blocks resolve the name to different origins.\n\nA call at the first byte of an embedded script kept its local offset,\nbecause the source map returns an empty span at offset 0 unchanged.\nThe call now maps a one-byte span. The extraction cache version\nchanges, because cached call offsets were wrong for these files.\n\nThe CHANGELOG now also states that `export default Name` links to the\nlocal binding `Name`, which changes unused class members and\nignoreExportsUsedInFile results for that form.","tree":{"sha":"eb2de5648c3863fe51866f3c391bfba79eccb5bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fallow-rs/fallow/git/trees/eb2de5648c3863fe51866f3c391bfba79eccb5bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fallow-rs/fallow/git/commits/920b2c0e2e05c2e0e718235a933f0ddab5f8e432","verification":{"payload":"tree eb2de5648c3863fe51866f3c391bfba79eccb5bc\nparent 1b1b9dd6d5015f77cf911887c2e9a1d0f4256e5c\nauthor Bart Waardenburg <bart@waardenburg.dev> 1791260936 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791260936 +0200\n\nfix(policy): check gdp proof calls across repeated script imports (#3233)\n\nA Vue, Svelte, or Astro file can import the same name in two script\nblocks. The gdp-proof-producer rule abstained on every repeated name,\nso a defineProof call in such a file gave no finding. The rule now\nabstains only when the blocks resolve the name to different origins.\n\nA call at the first byte of an embedded script kept its local offset,\nbecause the source map returns an empty span at offset 0 unchanged.\nThe call now maps a one-byte span. The extraction cache version\nchanges, because cached call offsets were wrong for these files.\n\nThe CHANGELOG now also states that `export default Name` links to the\nlocal binding `Name`, which changes unused class members and\nignoreExportsUsedInFile results for that form.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxHkICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiCIQACMZntmGNbB4YXUapTwYMuHj\nehrHr0b4H6lZ+I+pqlMWKwr4YyVBnk19a9EWrEIaHnx7xmy1XUeG6d+Os/9wrFse\nSHo/ye4EmieWZrKFDCC5mmP49SH7IBUMicHzb8Fg4BcF2tzZUy99ZzUNIOV80YgZ\ne0i/ZKxlsrus1fqmksqOPey4x0z8hyVNr/vkhGFdu17QlU2F1CL0HjtReOVAgUe3\nRJDBr1j+JtzyDwriaC+evFGeE4bQw9PQ8ZPvGSE9JOA2TOgAW+/2bA27oG2e2jBK\nNuvzT86kI0DZyRvDsHX1r6cZkCuR3d6cLESsAWfZHj7NzMB7xedkZrgm7LkMvia1\nTClGG9z5anOAuQy+ge8HSj1xfv8eecYzHlT6j3sIcypc5hCwOMzuMLGaAp0dak+4\noDnwtA/Bjife3PParNEFSC3UMNF5e2tMxenrOo1czEQSbPyTIT4lNQBqdMaGVI8/\n4LeaqdgQxKOEtDwiH5d8jQ39PwEFElpNwi49FeimIlXa82tEuDfQ4/dBAc1J4Voo\nbXQ32hnS0NjnGt1Z2lPZ/iOWh22c9X5oYm0i9CHOhvyn2gOepM0VHloo3IPlFzmm\nr7h36OCnfJCweWCoSYnUqCtlyTyvnxJQWrWeBUl+V5ICG54Dh9NTsmNYHBtChyIj\nR+Phz14F6BF+W5eh+pBF\n=m8FP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T04:28:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gra