irect with localStorage persistence\n- Implement smart session title generation from first user message with fallback logic\n- Add session title persistence to database with Alembic migration\n- Improve relative date formatting in SessionSidebar (e.g., \"5m\", \"3h\", \"2d\")\n- Enhance checkout modal to save chat session before opening Stripe payment URL\n- Add order confirmation card rendering after payment redirect with line items and totals\n- Disable unnecessary React Query refetching (on window focus, mount, reconnect)\n- Fix ProductSlider sending state reset with timeout to allow re-selection\n- Update chat service to support order confirmation messages\n- Refactor session repository to handle title updates and retrieval\n- Improve citation service and tool registry for better message handling","tree":{"sha":"9673a25535dfb699efe6891f190164f6ab9d860c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/git/trees/9673a25535dfb699efe6891f190164f6ab9d860c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/git/commits/03e041be7879d0a72631d807aeb4b93390a74b7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206687058?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yelkur-Raghavendra","id":206687058,"login":"Yelkur-Raghavendra","node_id":"U_kgDODFHLUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur