i"},"message":"feat(stripe): integrate Stripe payment processing end-to-end\n\n- Add StripeModule with webhook controller and payment intent provider\n- Create POST /stripe/webhooks endpoint to handle payment_intent.succeeded and payment_intent.payment_failed events\n- Add createOrGetPaymentIntent method to CheckoutSessionService for PaymentIntent creation and retrieval\n- Add POST /commerce/checkout-sessions/:id/payment-intent endpoint to request PaymentIntent from frontend\n- Add stripePaymentIntentId and stripeClientSecret columns to CheckoutSession entity via migration\n- Replace CheckoutModal card form inputs with Stripe Elements PaymentElement\n- Add PAYMENT_FAILED status to UcpCheckoutStatus enum\n- Update checkout flow tests and add backward compatibility e2e test\n- Enqueue order.confirmed event on BullMQ when payment succeeds via webhook\n- Maintain backward compatibility with existing SKIP_UCP_OUTBOUND dev mode and /complete endpoint","tree":{"sha":"6f7fbe69b939dc74101a0260b770ea7ac100a251","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/git/trees/6f7fbe69b939dc74101a0260b770ea7ac100a251"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/git/commits/6d124151d077e212c059adfff132e9037ecea022","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129540234?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajurangoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajurangoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajurangoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajurangoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rajurangoji","id":129540234,"login":"rajurangoji","node_id":"U_kgDOB7igig","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajurangoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.git