w","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/commit/7dc4b3bf86af0b8475171cfc18a1300860ea8618","node_id":"C_kwDORpTrG9oAKDdkYzRiM2JmODZhZjBiODQ3NTE3MWNmYzE4YTEzMDA4NjBlYTg2MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/commit/95f6700d64b70a8cb5d0b2ad2d6e94a224e27756","sha":"95f6700d64b70a8cb5d0b2ad2d6e94a224e27756","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/commits/95f6700d64b70a8cb5d0b2ad2d6e94a224e27756"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/commit/0d5562fa809c2e2d055fd407f9887972f24d85d0","sha":"0d5562fa809c2e2d055fd407f9887972f24d85d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/commits/0d5562fa809c2e2d055fd407f9887972f24d85d0"}],"sha":"7dc4b3bf86af0b8475171cfc18a1300860ea8618","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/commits/7dc4b3bf86af0b8475171cfc18a1300860ea8618"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206687058?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yelkur-Raghavendra","id":206687058,"login":"Yelkur-Raghavendra","node_id":"U_kgDODFHLUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/commits/0d5562fa809c2e2d055fd407f9887972f24d85d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:56:37Z","email":"raghavendrayelkuri@andinolabs.com","name":"Yelkuri Raghavendra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:56:37Z","email":"raghavendrayelkuri@andinolabs.com","name":"Yelkuri Raghavendra"},"message":"feat: major enhancements — streaming, caching, bug fixes, optimizations\n\n## Streaming Chat (SSE)\n- New POST /api/v1/chat/stream endpoint with Server-Sent Events\n- LLM tokens streamed word-by-word with blinking cursor UX\n- JSON parser extracts answer from streamed {\"answer\":\"...\",\"suggestions\":[...]}\n- Suggestions come from same LLM generation (zero extra calls)\n- Rule-based fallback suggestions when LLM JSON parsing fails\n- 30s fetch timeout + partial content preservation on disconnect\n\n## Redis Caching + Distributed Rate Limiting\n- New redis_client.py with graceful fallback (app works without Redis)\n- RAG results cached (5min TTL, hash-based keys)\n- Customer profiles cached with write-through invalidation\n- Rate limiter upgraded: Redis-based distributed + in-memory fallback\n- Init/close wired into FastAPI lifespan\n\n## Bug Fixes (26 bugs across all 3 services)\n- Frontend: missing expect imports, session_id mismatches, CSS selectors\n- Backend: total_sessions tracking, race condition (FOR UPDATE), token budget\n- RAG: SQL injection fix, embedding count validation, API key auth enforced\n- Streaming: token estimation for budget tracking, cursor lifecycle\n\n## Performance Optimizations\n- asyncio.gather for memory loading + RAG compare calls\n- Token-aware history trimming (800 token budget)\n- React.memo on ChatMessage, MessageBubble, ProductSlider\n- React Query for sessions + message history caching\n- Embedding batch size 100→300, business rules + skill files cached\n- RAG result deduplication across all tool handlers\n\n## Architecture Improvements\n- All prompts externalized to config/prompts.json\n- Product comparison renders as HTML tables\n- Multi-select product cards with Compare button\n- Shoe-only store scope in system prompt\n- /end requires confirmation, session status persisted across refresh\n- Cross-tab session sync via StorageEvent\n- URL encodes session_id for deep linking\n- Input maxLength=2000, accessibility (ARIA, keyboard nav)\n- CLAUDE.md added for codebase documentation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78b524c609697d9fc46d953ce541d26d3b74ca80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/git/trees/78b524c609697d9fc46d953ce541d26d3b74ca80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YelkuriRaghavendra/Agentic-Shopping-Assistant/git/commits/0d5562fa809c2e2d055fd407f9887972f24d85d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206687058?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yelkur-Raghavendra","id":206687058,"login":"Yelkur-Raghavendra","node_id":"U_kgDODFHLUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yelkur-Raghavendra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.