/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/commits/9c39cb1eec291e4c53815de9fe711c38fd4a0355/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:42:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:42:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(codegen-setup): titulo do Passo 2.5 diz o que a condicao realmente e\n\n\"se existir\" era ambiguo depois da correcao anterior: aqui a condicao e o\nprototipo ter sido CONSTRUIDO no projeto-alvo (codigo), nao a pasta docs/\nprototype/ existir. O corpo do passo ja dizia isso; o titulo nao.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HJZx7juL61JEqubSQHTwtz","tree":{"sha":"a8ed48c30224b081c42a96fc859be12c9ff284e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/git/trees/a8ed48c30224b081c42a96fc859be12c9ff284e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/git/commits/9c39cb1eec291e4c53815de9fe711c38fd4a0355","verification":{"payload":"tree a8ed48c30224b081c42a96fc859be12c9ff284e6\nparent 9c3743def3ae780cdf0ec39abc9fb6a527937248\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789634555 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789634555 +0000\n\nfix(codegen-setup): titulo do Passo 2.5 diz o que a condicao realmente e\n\n\"se existir\" era ambiguo depois da correcao anterior: aqui a condicao e o\nprototipo ter sido CONSTRUIDO no projeto-alvo (codigo), nao a pasta docs/\nprototype/ existir. O corpo do passo ja dizia isso; o titulo nao.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HJZx7juL61JEqubSQHTwtz\n","reason":"val