ers/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/commits/c98e8fd5f00093cf7a14fe99a695f6b82b351c69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T02:34:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T02:34:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs(blueprint): 3o ciclo — grupos do /specs, escopo do /patch e recontagens\n\nAchado com impacto direto no backlog gerado: o /specs declara 14 grupos de task\nno mapa de extracao (inclui CTRL para controllers e VAL para validacao) mas lista\nso 12 na estrutura de saida. Seguir a lista de saida faz o TASKS.md perder duas\ncamadas inteiras. Registrado nos dois lugares onde os grupos aparecem.\n\nQuarta lacuna estrutural do framework: /patch varre blueprint, backend,\nfrontend/shared, frontend/*, shared, specs e adr — docs/templates/ e\ndocs/diagrams/ ficam de fora, e /increment tambem nao os alcanca. Ou seja, a\ndivergencia do nome do diagrama web e as 8 ocorrencias de caminho obsoleto no\nclaudemd-template exigem edicao manual. O framework corrige a si mesmo, mas nao\ncorrige as proprias ferramentas.\n\nRecontagens verificadas:\n- caminhos obsoletos: 37 ocorrencias em 25 arquivos (eram \"19 em 11\"), agora em\n  quatro classes, incluindo 01-arquitetura.md em 6 docs de cliente e os\n  conectores cross-layer error-ux-mapping e event-mapping\n- \"outros 28 documentos\" misturava o universo de 3 clientes com o de 1: sao 54\n- abertura de 17.4 dizia \"quatro divergencias\" onde a tabela lista seis\n\nTambem:\n- arvore: completa a lista de blocos do master sem equivalente modular — 9.5/9.6\n  (retencao, backup, RPO/RTO) e 20.1 (SLA/SLO/error budget, que nao aparece em\n  nenhum dos 17 docs modulares)\n- 15.1: aviso de que o router usa os nomes reais e o template de origem nao\n- 2.2: consumo de backend/05-api-contracts pelo /frontend e condicional\n- 3.4: qualifica a lacuna do /specs — o Passo 3 cobre, o checklist final nao\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HJZx7juL61JEqubSQHTwtz","tree":{"sha":"b500c1e39a249d5742d742fccfc48e9dc952c5ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/git/trees/b500c1e39a249d5742d742fccfc48e9dc952c5ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/git/commits/c98e8fd5f00093cf7a14fe99a695f6b82b351c69","verification":{"payload":"tree b500c1e39a249d5742d742fccfc48e9dc952c5ca\nparent fc7fc72c8c6fe68b423d9a362c5f767155d7d407\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789612477 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789612477 +0000\n\ndocs(blueprint): 3o ciclo — grupos do /specs, escopo do /patch e recontagens\n\nAchado com impacto direto no backlog gerado: o /specs declara 14 grupos de task\nno mapa de extracao (inclui CTRL para controllers e VAL para validacao) mas lista\nso 12 na estrutura de saida. Seguir a lista de saida faz o TASKS.md perder duas\ncamadas inteiras. Registrado nos dois lugares onde os grupos aparecem.\n\nQuarta lacuna estrutural do framework: /patch varre blueprint, backend,\nfrontend/shared, frontend/*, shared, specs e adr — docs/templates/ e\ndocs/diagrams/ ficam de fora, e /increment tambem nao os alcanca. Ou seja, a\ndivergencia do nome do diagrama web e as 8 ocorrencias de caminho obsoleto no\nclaudemd-template exigem edicao manual. O framework corrige a si mesmo, mas nao\ncorrige as proprias ferramentas.\n\nRecontagens verificadas:\n- caminhos obsoletos: 37 ocorrencias em 25 arquivos (eram \"19 em 11\"), agora em\n  quatro classes, incluindo 01-arquitetura.md em 6 docs de cliente e os\n  conectores cross-layer error-ux-mapping e event-mapping\n- \"outros 28 documentos\" misturava o universo de 3 clientes com o de 1: sao 54\n- abertura de 17.4 dizia \"quatro divergencias\" onde a tabela lista seis\n\nTambem:\n- arvore: completa a lista de blocos do master sem equivalente modular — 9.5/9.6\n  (retencao, backup, RPO/RTO) e 20.1 (SLA/SLO/error budget, que nao aparece em\n  nenhum dos 17 docs modulares)\n- 15.1: aviso de que o router usa os nomes reais e o template de origem nao\n- 2.2: consumo de backend/05-api-contracts pelo /frontend e condicional\n- 3.4: qualifica a lacuna do /specs — o Passo 3 cobre, o checklist final nao\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HJZx7juL61JEqubSQHTwtz\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOeG4c+P\n0yj0Em0nd7tqhhsL/Knb5AcpyHH/YyInQot0FvaHR3j2JJokWb0f5rg16wGJE23n0FG94HFZCKaC\nXQ0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T02:34:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DouglasPrado/blueprint/commit/c98e8fd5f00093cf7a14fe99a695f6b82b351c69","node_id":"C_kwDORpf-7doAKGM5OGU4ZmQ1ZjAwMDkzY2Y3YTE0ZmU5OWE2OTVmNmI4MmIzNTFjNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DouglasPrado/blueprint/commit/fc7fc72c8c6fe68b423d9a362c5f767155d7d407","sha":"fc7fc72c8c6fe68b423d9a362c5f767155d7d407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/commits/fc7fc72c8c6fe68b423d9a362c5f767155d7d407"}],"sha":"c98e8fd5f00093cf7a14fe99a695f6b82b351c69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/commits/c98e8fd5f00093cf7a14fe99a695f6b82b351c69"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/commits/fc7fc72c8c6fe68b423d9a362c5f767155d7d407/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T02:25:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T02:25:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs(blueprint): 2o ciclo de revisao — lacunas do framework e correcoes finais\n\nAchado mais consequente, verificado nas 21 skills: NENHUMA skill gera\ndocs/shared/. As 12 fases do /pipeline vao de blueprint-foundation a\ncodegen-setup e nao incluem glossary, error-ux-mapping, event-mapping nem\nMAPPING; /specs, /codegen-* e /patch apenas leem. Na pratica o /pipeline\nentrega 48 documentos preenchidos, nao 52 — e justamente os 4 que impedem os\nblueprints de divergirem ficam como template. Registrado em 14.3 com as\nconsequencias e o contorno manual.\n\nCorrecoes factuais:\n- \"12-evolution\" nao existe (era 16-evolution)\n- Historico de Decisoes: os 24 arquivos sao so os docs 07-14 de cada cliente\n  frontend; nenhum de backend, blueprint ou frontend/shared\n- riscos/restricoes/premissas TEM casa modular (00-context, 11-build_plan); o\n  que o README.MD 15 acrescenta sao IDs, owner, \"impacto se falsa\" e \"fonte\"\n- 60 marcadores de frontend, nao 59\n- /increment oferece \"shared\" so como cliente de frontend; docs/shared/ nunca\n- /increment tambem omite relationships, external-dependencies e\n  security-checklist entre os docs que reconhece\n\nDivergencias ampliadas (agora 6, consolidadas em 17.4):\n- caminhos em portugues/flat obsoletos: 19 ocorrencias em 11 arquivos,\n  incluindo os proprios docs gerados e os compartilhados — deriva sistemica da\n  migracao flat -> multi-client, nao um template isolado\n- prefixo de regra de negocio: RN-XX (docs modulares, backend, /specs) vs\n  RB-01 (README.MD e use-case-template); seguir RN-XX\n- dono do auth-flow.mmd movido para o indice consolidado\n\nConteudo acrescentado:\n- SLA x SLO x error budget, com a regra SLO < SLA e o uso do orcamento de erro\n- testes nao funcionais: soak, failover, cold start, restore de backup\n- retencao/arquivamento e backup (RPO/RTO) como bloco do modelo de dados\n- README.MD 11 \"Integracoes e Interfaces\" — o unico bloco do master sem\n  equivalente modular\n- 6 lacunas SaaS: metering de uso, usuario em multiplas organizacoes, webhooks\n  de saida como feature, preferencias de notificacao, entregabilidade de e-mail\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HJZx7juL61JEqubSQHTwtz","tree":{"sha":"0cbf65c181ced22ff83bdba80d262dc3c66958fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/git/trees/0cbf65c181ced22ff83bdba80d262dc3c66958fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/git/commits/fc7fc72c8c6fe68b423d9a362c5f767155d7d407","verification":{"payload":"tree 0cbf65c181ced22ff83bdba80d262dc3c66958fd\nparent b3ea17c98f3cb021342cf02959aaf240d5ed6b84\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789611924 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789611924 +0000\n\ndocs(blueprint): 2o ciclo de revisao — lacunas do framework e correcoes finais\n\nAchado mais consequente, verificado nas 21 skills: NENHUMA skill gera\ndocs/shared/. As 12 fases do /pipeline vao de blueprint-foundation a\ncodegen-setup e nao incluem glossary, error-ux-mapping, event-mapping nem\nMAPPING; /specs, /codegen-* e /patch apenas leem. Na pratica o /pipeline\nentrega 48 documentos preenchidos, nao 52 — e justamente os 4 que impedem os\nblueprints de divergirem ficam como template. Registrado em 14.3 com as\nconsequencias e o contorno manual.\n\nCorrecoes factuais:\n- \"12-evolution\" nao existe (era 16-evolution)\n- Historico de Decisoes: os 24 arquivos sao so os docs 07-14 de cada cliente\n  frontend; nenhum de backend, blueprint ou frontend/shared\n- riscos/restricoes/premissas TEM casa modular (00-context, 11-build_plan); o\n  que o README.MD 15 acrescenta sao IDs, owner, \"impacto se falsa\" e \"fonte\"\n- 60 marcadores de frontend, nao 59\n- /increment oferece \"shared\" so como cliente de frontend; docs/shared/ nunca\n- /increment tambem omite relationships, external-dependencies e\n  security-checklist entre os docs que reconhece\n\nDivergencias ampliadas (agora 6, consolidadas em 17.4):\n- caminhos em portugues/flat obsoletos: 19 ocorrencias em 11 arquivos,\n  incluindo os proprios docs gerados e os compartilhados — deriva sistemica da\n  migracao flat -> multi-client, nao um template isolado\n- prefixo de regra de negocio: RN-XX (docs modulares, backend, /specs) vs\n  RB-01 (README.MD e use-case-template); seguir RN-XX\n- dono do auth-flow.mmd movido para o indice consolidado\n\nConteudo acrescentado:\n- SLA x SLO x error budget, com a regra SLO < SLA e o uso do orcamento de erro\n- testes nao funcionais: soak, failover, cold start, restore de backup\n- retencao/arquivamento e backup (RPO/RTO) como bloco do modelo de dados\n- README.MD 11 \"Integracoes e Interfaces\" — o unico bloco do master sem\n  equivalente modular\n- 6 lacunas SaaS: metering de uso, usuario em multiplas organizacoes, webhooks\n  de saida como feature, preferencias de notificacao, entregabilidade de e-mail\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HJZx7juL61JEqubSQHTwtz\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAaTig/b\ns8DZ8MHWQh1fUOQWXqFPkjEvFJxAPVtlQvmTrlcssS8rbtbz9ZAmPG/LMY8qwVn2UX541F6K6RmA\nMw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T02:25:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_