or":{"date":"2026-09-17T02:02:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T02:02:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: adiciona blueprint.md — mapa integral do que e fundamental para um SaaS\n\nConsolida os 3 blueprints (tecnico, backend, frontend), os 4 documentos\ncross-layer, os templates, os diagramas C4 e as 21 skills num unico arquivo\nmestre, com a correlacao completa entre eles.\n\nConteudo:\n- 14 pilares de um SaaS, ordenados por irreversibilidade\n- cadeia de derivacao PRD -> blueprint -> backend/frontend -> specs -> codigo\n- matriz de rastreabilidade consolidada (incl. as regras de consistencia\n  cruzada exigidas pelas skills e ausentes do MAPPING.md)\n- detalhamento das 6 fases do blueprint tecnico, dos 15 docs de backend e\n  dos 16 docs de frontend (shared + por cliente, com adaptacao de plataforma)\n- camada cross-layer: glossario, error-ux-mapping, event-mapping\n- parte dedicada ao que e especifico de SaaS: multi-tenancy, billing, quotas,\n  onboarding, compliance — com as lacunas do framework marcadas explicitamente\n- contrato das skills, estrategia de contexto, checklists e anti-patterns\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HJZx7juL61JEqubSQHTwtz","tree":{"sha":"02fa9fe818d26f36a00307f9067e3f31d6cabd3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/git/trees/02fa9fe818d26f36a00307f9067e3f31d6cabd3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DouglasPrado/blueprint/git/commits/1e3d9a27526ba103bdb1b615d310dcb9108538a7","verification":{"payload":"tree 02fa9fe818d26f36a00307f9067e3f31d6cabd3d\nparent 5a6c4c2ea5484731d1fa6a31392b265b2cb6dfef\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789610525 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789610525 +0000\n\ndocs: adiciona blueprint.md — mapa integral do que e fundamental para um SaaS\n\nConsolida os 3 blueprints (tecnico, backend, frontend), os 4 documentos\ncross-layer, os templates, os diagramas C4 e as 21 skills num unico arquivo\nmestre, com a correlacao completa entre eles.\n\nConteudo:\n- 14 pilares de um SaaS, ordenados por irreversibilidade\n- cadeia de derivacao PRD -> blueprint -> backend/frontend -> specs -> codigo\n- matriz de rastreabilidade consolidada (incl. as regras de consistencia\n  cruzada exigidas pelas skills e ausentes do MAPPING.md)\n- detalhamento das 6 fases do blueprint tecnico, dos 15 docs de backend e\n  dos 16 docs de frontend (shared + por cliente, com adaptacao de plataforma)\n- camada cross-layer: glossario, error-ux-mapping, event-mapping\n- parte dedicada ao que e especifico de SaaS: multi-tenancy, billing, quotas,\n  onboarding, compliance — com as lacunas do framework marcadas explicitamente\n- contrato das skills, estrategia de contexto, checklists e anti-patterns\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HJZx7juL61JEqubSQHTwtz\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNB2PutE\nMx6S/UJBaQEKVgisGdg+KHHdp9NhhK5Lq+T7ZqEa+O5vUcWhyPZVY/UeInZKws/azuXjDUmFObFb\nLAA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T02:02:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received