pital, clinic, office) for type differentiation\n- Consolidated 4 visit endpoints (2 GET + 2 POST) into 2 consolidated endpoints (1 GET + 1 POST)\n- Updated OpenAPI spec: removed separate paths, added consolidated /api/patients/{id}/visits path\n- Simplified tags: merged ''Physician Visits'' and ''Hospital Visits'' into ''Visits''\n- Updated all visit-related unit tests to use visitType field\n- Added validation test for invalid visitType enum values\n- All 27 tests passing (4 visit tests consolidated from 6)\n- Code coverage: 71.88% statements\n- Docker containers rebuilt and healthy","tree":{"sha":"e716a16ea63bb1440828197192efbed2b51ee077","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jabbour-labs/patientrecords.pub/git/trees/e716a16ea63bb1440828197192efbed2b51ee077"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jabbour-labs/patientrecords.pub/git/commits/c7f6adb0b78ca50540cee4c69b669e2ceaa401b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234266105?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro","id":234266105,"login":"sultanj-pro","node_id":"U_kgDODfad-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://githu