oints for updating clinical records\n\n- Add 5 PUT endpoints: vitals, labs, medications, physician-visits, hospital-visits\n- Support partial updates with field merging using object spread\n- Uses Mongoose markModified() for proper nested array update tracking\n- Returns 200 with updated record on success\n- Handles: 404 for missing patient/record, 400 for validation errors\n- Update OpenAPI spec with complete PUT operations and request/response schemas\n- Add 16 comprehensive unit tests (success + validation for each resource type)\n- Add 5 additional tests for missing record and error scenarios\n- Code coverage: 75.3% statements, 80.85% functions\n- All 38 tests passing","tree":{"sha":"05e7c61f33d0727f2bae96a73558220187e3b60d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jabbour-labs/patientrecords.pub/git/trees/05e7c61f33d0727f2bae96a73558220187e3b60d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jabbour-labs/patientrecords.pub/git/commits/38493be5afb9805d6f11f69a754e3b1943fb4411","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234266105?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro","id":234266105,"login":"sultanj-pro","node_id":"U_kgDODfad-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sultanj-pro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https