/github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-growth-chart-app/commits/1c823ab57d869a561b1f1a9df759a2241d53258a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T12:48:42Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T13:05:37Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"message":"(fix) Improve empty states, translation coverage, and reference chart selection\n\nEmpty states and copy:\n- Explain why the growth chart is unavailable for patients older than\n  5 years instead of showing a generic empty state that implied\n  missing data\n- Reframe the unknown/other gender flow as choosing a reference chart\n  rather than selecting the patient''s gender, with an accessible\n  legend on the radio group and Male reference / Female reference\n  options\n- Relabel the notification action to \"Edit patient details\" since it\n  navigates to registration rather than updating the gender\n- Fix casing and grammar across strings; keys whose meaning changed\n  (editPatientDetails, showingReferenceChart) were renamed so stale\n  translations cannot linger\n\nTranslations:\n- Extract from all .ts sources (excluding tests) so the chart title\n  and axis labels reach Transifex; they were previously hardcoded\n  English\n- Make the left nav link translatable via a literal ''Growth chart''\n  key, matching the patient chart convention\n\nChart styling:\n- Restore the custom chart styling lost in the Carbon Charts v1\n  upgrade: the bx-- selectors were dead, so percentile curves were\n  not dashed and the patient line was not emphasized. Year tick\n  bolding accounts for the v1 ticks DOM\n- Remove the 0.x-era tooltip rule rather than porting it: showTotal\n  is already disabled, so there is no Total row to hide, and in v1\n  the rule hid the lowest-valued series in the ruler tooltip\n- Anchor the toolbar export menu to its trigger and let its items\n  span the menu, using the same logical-property overrides as the\n  vitals chart in openmrs-esm-patient-chart\n- Give the y-axis title and legend breathing room by painting the\n  chart frame background on the padded container, inset from the\n  card edges (the chart''s internal layout is fixed by its height\n  option, so it cannot be padded directly)\n\nThe e2e assertions are updated to the new copy; the unavailable-state\nspec was originally written against copy that never shipped.","tree":{"sha":"e25cbd635336b113e940c386623794387ae8a04c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-growth-chart-app/git/trees/e25cbd635336b113e940c386623794387ae8a04c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-growth-chart-app/git/commits/1c823ab57d869a561b1f1a9df759a2241d53258a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-growth-chart-app/commit/1c823ab57d869a561b1f1a9df759a2241d53258a","node_id":"C_kwDORqWPy9oAKDFjODIzYWI1N2Q4NjlhNTYxYjFmMWE5ZGY3NTlhMjI0MWQ1MzI1OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-growth-chart-app/commit/3ac0a7260c9eb754bef082a8eb8b27d2ad8f43e8","sha":"3ac0a7260c9eb754bef082a8eb8b27d2ad8f43e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-growth-chart-app/commits/3ac0a7260c9eb754bef082a8eb8b27d2ad8f43e8"}],"sha":"1c823ab57d869a561b1f1a9df759a2241d53258a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-growth-chart-app/commits/1c823ab57d869a561b1f1a9df759a2241d53258a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-growth-chart-app/commits/3ac0a7260c9eb754bef082a8eb8b27d2ad8f43e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T12:10:18Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T12:12:58Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"message":"(chore) Bump OpenMRS tooling to the current next releases\n\nThe lockfile pinned the openmrs tooling, @openmrs/esm-framework, and\n@openmrs/rspack-config next tags to 9.0.3-pre.4473, while next now\nresolves to 10.0.1-pre.5009 and app shells in the wild run framework\n10. The stale esm-framework peer range of 9.x made module federation\nreject the shell''s shared framework singleton:\n\n  Version 10.0.1-pre.5009 from @openmrs/esm-app-shell of shared\n  singleton module @openmrs/esm-framework does not satisfy the\n  requirement of @openmrs/esm-patient-growth-chart-app which needs 9.x\n\n- Refresh the lockfile so next resolves to 10.0.1-pre.5009\n- Bump the @openmrs/esm-framework peer range to 10.x, matching the\n  patient chart apps\n- Drop the @openmrs/* tsconfig path alias. It bypassed package exports\n  maps, so framework 10''s typings resolved @openmrs/esm-globals src\n  files alongside the dist typings and tsc failed on the duplicate\n  __webpack_share_scopes__ global. Bare imports resolve correctly\n  through node_modules without it\n- Apply yarn dedupe; yarn dedupe --check is now clean\n\nVerified against a local dev server: the federation warning and the\ngetImportMapOverrideMap devtools error are gone on the framework 10\nshell, and the growth chart loads and renders.","tree":{"sha":"99db888f7399d550207c165e8cf4ef7d07b7e49c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-growth-chart-app/git/trees/99db888f7399d550207c165e8cf4ef7d07b7e49c"},"url":"https://api.gi