ic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/gastown-pilot/commits/702596f9e8ca678300709d4b745d79d6f0f9b332/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:41:01Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:41:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(browser-app): never reach for localhost in production bundles (#19)\n\nframe.jim.software?app=gastown-pilot polled http://localhost:3018/api/*\n(9 endpoints, every 5s) because VITE_API_URL is unset on Vercel and\nsix files each defaulted to loopback — Chrome shows every visitor a\nLocal Network Access prompt.\n\n- hooks/api.ts: single API_BASE (localhost:3018 in dev only, empty in\n  prod) and fetchOrMock, which returns mock data without fetching when\n  no API is configured.\n- useGasTown/useWasteland/useBeads/useFormulas/RigsView: use it.\n- ChatPanel: \"API not configured\" instead of fetching loopback.\n- scripts/check-no-loopback.sh + CI step after build.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd074192104909bae7cd2189fbe0aff0e3c4f605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/gastown-pilot/git/trees/dd074192104909bae7cd2189fbe0aff0e3c4f605"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/gastown-pilot/git/commits/702596f9e8ca678300709d4b745d79d6f0f9b332","verification":{"payload":"tree dd074192104909bae7cd2189fbe0aff0e3c4f605\nparent 884fd86f3fa49f33781d838a9444afbcc25dc3e1\nauthor ojfbot <151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com> 1790887261 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790887261 -0500\n\nfix(browser-app): never reach for localhost in production bundles (#19)\n\nframe.jim.software?app=gastown-pilot polled http://localhost:3018/api/*\n(9 endpoints, every 5s) because VITE_API_URL is unset on Vercel and\nsix files each defaulted to loopback — Chrome shows every visitor a\nLocal Network Access prompt.\n\n- hooks/api.ts: single API_BASE (l