adr, convoy, molecule)\n- EventStream: 15 events covering convoy:start, molecule:started, agent:spawn,\n  mail:sent, hook:assigned, bead:complete, agent:stall, agent:error\n- FormulasView: 5 formulas (scaffold-app, storybook-rollout, deploy-demo,\n  wasteland-patrol, wasteland-join) with realistic step graphs\n- WastelandView: 8 wanted items, stamp history, 8-entry leaderboard with\n  trust tiers, 6 recent activity entries\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12b739c43756ec566ed8e109004f9efe39ab3b89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/gastown-pilot/git/trees/12b739c43756ec566ed8e109004f9efe39ab3b89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/gastown-pilot/git/commits/51a540ce9f43f322c513ee458a2d50a2e6547c5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/gastown-pilot/commit/51a540ce9f43f322c513ee458a2d50a2e6547c5b","node_id":"C_kwDORql86doAKDUxYTU0MGNlOWY0M2YzMjJjNTEzZWU0NThhMmQ1MGEyZTY1NDdjNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https: